Analytics ai tool selection and costs
title end

paragraph start
Choose a tool by what it must do, how it handles the data entered, whether its output may be used commercially and what it costs. Record each answer with its source and date.
paragraph end

paragraph start
No cost or term is written from memory. Read the tool terms page and note the date.
